WEBVTT

00:06:58.527 --> 00:07:03.688
like slowly moving his favorite toy
from his right hand

00:07:03.712 --> 00:07:06.879
across and by in front
of him to his left side

00:07:07.726 --> 00:07:10.276
to prompt movement in his left arm.

00:07:11.518 --> 00:07:13.507
And at the end of each week,

00:07:13.531 --> 00:07:15.787
we would review our results as a team:

00:07:16.225 --> 00:07:17.998
How did OT go?

00:07:18.577 --> 00:07:20.570
How did physio go?

00:07:20.594 --> 00:07:22.710
How did stimulation go?

00:07:22.734 --> 00:07:24.634
Did we meet our goal?

00:07:26.523 --> 00:07:31.012
Because frequent communication
is very important on an agile project,